# Build-context exclusions for `docker build` / `docker buildx bake`
# from the repository root. R6.1 §4.5 made this the only
# .dockerignore in the repo: every image uses the repo-root build
# context (proto/ codegen happens inside each builder stage —
# ADR-0007), so a single ignore file is the right scope. R6.1 §8
# rewrote the file to a deny-by-default + negate-include shape so
# the build context stays well under 50 MB even as the repo grows.
#
# Pattern:
#   1. Deny everything (`*`).
#   2. Negate-include the top-level directories any image's stages
#      need: proto/, core/, adapters/, tools/codegen/, build/docker/.
#   3. Re-deny generated trees inside those directories so
#      contributor-side `proto/gen/`, `node_modules/`, `target/`,
#      `.venv/`, etc., don't pollute the context.
#
# Adding a new top-level directory that any image needs requires a
# negation entry here; otherwise the build will fail with "file not
# found" inside the COPY step.

# 1) Deny everything by default.
*

# 2) Negate-include the directories every image's stages might need.
!proto/
!core/
!adapters/
!tools/codegen/
!build/docker/

# 3) Re-deny generated trees, language caches, and build artefacts
#    that live under the include-set above. These are produced by
#    the contributor's host workflow and have no business in the
#    image build context — every Dockerfile regenerates them inside
#    its own builder stage.

# Generated protocol bindings (regenerated by buf inside each
# builder stage — ADR-0007).
proto/gen/
adapters/playwright/src/proto/

# Rust build artefacts.
**/target/

# Go build outputs at component roots.
core/control-plane/bin/
adapters/curl-impersonate/bin/
*.exe
*.test

# Node / pnpm.
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/.pnpm-store/
**/.turbo/
**/.tsbuildinfo
*.tsbuildinfo

# Python virtualenvs and caches.
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.uv-cache/
*.py[cod]

# Editor / OS noise that may live anywhere under the include-set.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
*~
